        "true": [
          {
            "id": "ece04fff-d3c4-4cbe-a478-89690b7b3220",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "2b4a2636-73dc-438f-a219-6be59e2b95b6",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "52f472c9-ccf4-4f16-af35-d93a091f1b2a",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "For the EARLIER\nrelay-only\nfailure, before\nthe gate fault was\nadded, which",
                      "backup avoided the\nfailed relay? The\nnext check will\nseparately ask you\nto solve the",
                      "two-fault drill.\nKeep the two cases\ndistinct in the\nlog."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "4344e49f-c054-4a13-ac88-5a0a50fbe922",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dbbf3ad7-1c9c-4ad9-a194-274d90e9a8f7",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
